    <mxCell id="lg.t12" value="Log write, best effort" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="legend">
     <mxGeometry x="382" y="76" width="144" height="20" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="questions" value="&lt;b&gt;Open questions and assumptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; O-61: Thai PDPA wording, bundling with the profile consent, retention, and delete (to confirm with legal)&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; O-62: can a saved card work across brands' Omise accounts? No public feature found. To confirm with the gateway&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; O-63: the reading of 'share with minor_id' (customer, brand, or Minor ID itself), and the scope&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="928" y="940" width="748" height="104" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="L" value="&lt;b&gt;Not shared (the default)&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=2;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#475569;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="100" width="810" height="520" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="l1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;background-color:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:9px;padding:0px 6px;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Customer saves a card in Brand A&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#1D4ED8&quot;&gt;tick 'save this card'. The card goes from the browser to the gateway.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#1D4ED8&quot;&gt;NEXA keeps a gateway reference and display fields, never the number&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#2563EB;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="L">
     <mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="770" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="l2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;background-color:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:9px;padding:0px 6px;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Payment stores it for Brand A only&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#854D0E&quot;&gt;owner brand A. Listed and usable in Brand A&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#854D0E&quot;&gt;and nowhere else&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#EAB308;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="L">
     <mxGeometry x="20" y="190" width="770" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="l3" value="&lt;b style=&quot;background-color:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:9px;padding:0px 6px;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;In Brand B the customer types a card&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#1D4ED8&quot;&gt;B does not list A's card. The customer may save the new card&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#1D4ED8&quot;&gt;in B if B allows saved cards (saved_methods_enabled)&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#2563EB;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="L">
     <mxGeometry x="20" y="330" width="770" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="e.l1.l2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;jettySize=auto;" edge="1" parent="1" source="l1" target="l2">
     <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
     </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="e.l2.l3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;jettySize=auto;" edge="1" parent="1" source="l2" target="l3">
     <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
     </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="R" value="&lt;b&gt;Shared (the customer switched it on in Minor ID)&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=2;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#854D0E;strokeColor=#EAB308;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="866" y="100" width="810" height="520" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="r1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;background-color:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:9px;padding:0px 6px;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Customer opts in, once, in Minor ID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#854D0E&quot;&gt;consent purpose payment_method_sharing, owned by Identity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#854D0E&quot;&gt;Withdraw any time. Off by default&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#EAB308;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;" vertex="1" parent="R">
     <mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="770" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="r2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;background-color:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:9px;padding:0px 6px;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;A card saved in Brand A is also listed in Brand B&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#854D0E&quot;&gt;only if A and B pay through the same gateway account&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#854D0E&quot;&gt;(a payment_account_group) and B's membership is enabled&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#EAB308;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;" vertex="1" parent="R">
     <mxGeometry x="20" y="190" width="770" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="r3" value="&lt;b style=&quot;background-color:#0F172A;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:9px;padding:0px 6px;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;A brand with its own gateway account cannot use it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;a saved card lives inside one gateway account. Brands in their&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;own accounts do not see it. That is the gateway limit (section 4)&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;" vertex="1" parent="R">
     <mxGeometry x="20" y="330" width="770" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="e.r1.r2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;jettySize=auto;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r1" target="r2">
     <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
     </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="e.r2.r3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B91C1C;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;jettySize=auto;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r2" target="r3">
     <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
     </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="w1" value="&lt;b&gt;Today, with one gateway account per brand, nothing can be shared across brands with documented gateway features&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;The first draft builds the model (consent, saved-method store, account groups, audit). Every brand is a group of one until finance decides on a group&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;account, or the gateway confirms another way. This is stated plainly so nobody expects sharing before then (O-62)&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="650" width="1652" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Never shared:&lt;/b&gt; wallet balance and loyalty points (D-11), order history (that is the profile consent, P-33). A wallet is not a payment method here. A guest has no Minor ID, so a guest saves and shares nothing." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="780" width="1652" height="44" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
   </root>
  </mxGraphModel>
 </diagram>
 <diagram id="p2" name="2 Consent and where the data lives">
  <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="1060" math="0" shadow="0">
   <root>
    <mxCell id="0"/>
    <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
    <mxCell id="title" value="NEXA &amp;#8211; Identity owns the consent, Payment owns the saved methods, the gateway holds the card, and the bus carries ids only" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=22;fontColor=#0F172A;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
