    <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Also:&lt;/b&gt; a deleted Minor ID calls Payment to erase the gateway customers and cards (audit rows stay as the law needs, O-61). A brand whose membership is disabled for the customer (P-40) can neither list nor use shared methods." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
